                <pb facs="0734" n="632" sameAs="frus:frus1933v03/pg632"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.51/5740: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in China (Johnson) to the Secretary of
                        State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peiping</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-02-09T14:00:00+08:00">February 9, 1933—2
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received February 9—6:20 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>132. My 116, February 4, 11 a.m. I have just learned that National City Bank of
                    New York was offered the loan on a competitive bid basis.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Johnson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
